                                          5 Model 1: Predict Olympic medal counts by TMP-OMP Model.

                                          5.1 Explanation of the Dynamic Country Characteristics and Constant
                                          Country Properties
                                          5.1.1 Dynamic country characteristics
                                               In the context of the Olympic Games, dynamic country characteristics refer to factors that
                                          have a significant impact in the short term and change over time. For example, the host country
                                          effect (𝑯𝑬), the proportion of events participated in by each country (𝑵𝑬) and athletes’ per-
                                          formance in recent Olympic Games ( 𝑨𝑷 𝒊 ), Number of athlete participants (𝐍𝐀 𝐢,𝐭 ) and so on.




