                                                                      9.2 Weaknesses and Further Discussion

                                                                      ⚫     While the current model’s accuracy can still be improved, future efforts could focus on
                                                                            incorporating additional country-level data, such as population size and GDP. These
                                                                            macroeconomic indicators can provide a more comprehensive understanding of a na-
                                                                            tion's overall strength and its potential impact on Olympic medal performance, thereby
                                                                            improving prediction accuracy.
                                                                      ⚫     The model currently relies on medal counts to evaluate athlete performance and predict




                                                                                                                                            型
                                                                            future medal outcomes. To better assess athletes' true performance, future data collection
                                                                            should focus on athletes in the top 16, which will allow for a more nuanced analysis of




                                                                                                                                          模
                                                                            their capabilities and provide more professional insights for medal predictions.




